# Thunder Client / REST Client examples
# (VS Code: install "REST Client" and click "Send Request")

@host = http://localhost:5000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### List projects
GET {{host}}/api/projects

### Create project (auth)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Portfolio Website",
  "description": "My personal portfolio built with React",
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/me/portfolio",
  "liveUrl": "https://me.vercel.app"
}

### List posts
GET {{host}}/api/blog

### Create post (auth)
POST {{host}}/api/blog
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Hello World",
  "content": "My first blog post."
}

### Add comment (auth)
POST {{host}}/api/blog/PASTE_POST_ID/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "body": "Nice post!"
}

### Contact form
POST {{host}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visitor",
  "email": "visitor@example.com",
  "message": "Hello, I like your site!"
}

### Current user (auth) - useful to check a token
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update project (auth)
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/PASTE_PROJECT_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Portfolio Website v2"
}

### Delete project (auth)
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/PASTE_PROJECT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update post (auth + author only, 403 otherwise)
PUT {{host}}/api/blog/PASTE_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Updated content."
}

### Delete post (auth + author only)
DELETE {{host}}/api/blog/PASTE_POST_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List comments of a post (public)
GET {{host}}/api/blog/PASTE_POST_ID/comments
